se actual water temp for nu instead of 20C\nTODO: blockage correction? tank is 0.9 m wide x 0.75 m deep\nTODO: write up for Exp Fluids?\nrun_id,date,cylinder,diameter_mm,speed_m_s,water_temp_c,notes\n1,2025-10-14,1in,25.4,0.2,16.9,\n2,2025-10-14,1in,25.4,0.3,17.1,\n3,2025-10-14,1in,25.4,0.4,17.1,\n4,2025-10-14,1in,25.4,0.5,17.1,small wave from previous run\n5,2025-10-14,1in,25.4,0.6,17.1,\n6,2025-10-14,1in,25.4,0.7,17.4,\n7,2025-10-14,1in,25.4,0.8,17.4,\n8,2025-10-14,1in,25.4,0.9,17.5,\n9,2025-10-14,1in,25.4,1.0,17.6,\n10,2025-10-14,1in,25.4,1.1,17.6,\n11,2025-11-03,2in,50.8,0.2,15.0,\n12,2025-11-03,2in,50.8,0.3,15.1,\n13,2025-11-03,2in,50.8,0.4,15.1,\n14,2025-11-03,2in,50.8,0.5,15.2,\n15,2025-11-03,2in,50.8,0.6,15.1,\n16,2025-11-03,2in,50.8,0.7,15.3,\n17,2025-11-03,2in,50.8,0.8,15.3,zero off after run?\n18,2025-11-03,2in,50.8,0.9,15.5,\n19,2025-11-03,2in,50.8,1.0,15.4,\n20,2025-11-03,2in,50.8,1.1,15.6,\n21,2026-03-12,1.5in,38.1,0.2,13.7,\n22,2026-03-12,1.5in,38.1,0.3,13.8,\n23,2026-03-12,1.5in,38.1,0.4,13.8,\n24,2026-03-12,1.5in,38.1,0.5,14.0,\n25,2026-03-12,1.5in,38.1,0.6,14.1,\n26,2026-03-12,1.5in,38.1,0.7,14.0,\n27,2026-03-12,1.5in,38.1,0.8,14.2,\n28,2026-03-12,1.5in,38.1,0.9,14.2,\n29,2026-03-12,1.5in,38.1,1.0,14.3,\n30,2026-03-12,1.5in,38.1,1.1,14.3,\nrun,cylinder,diameter_mm,speed_m_s,water_temp_c,Re,Fr_D,F,Cd,u_Cd,Cd_rms,St,zero_shift_N,excluded\n1,1in,25.4,0.2,16.9,4689.8,0.40066,0.33268,1.0928,0.011979,0.072065,0.20023,-0.00056734,False\n2,1in,25.4,0.3,17.1,7070.1,0.60099,0.78546,1.1467,0.012346,0.061952,0.1997,-0.0012946,False\n3,1in,25.4,0.4,17.1,9426.8,0.80132,1.3344,1.0959,0.011799,0.05298,0.20023,7.4979e-05,False\n4,1in,25.4,0.5,17.1,11784,1.0017,2.1304,1.1197,0.012088,0.052803,0.19991,-0.00020994,False\n5,1in,25.4,0.6,17.1,14140,1.202,3.1012,1.1319,0.012232,0.052552,0.19996,-0.0022894,False\n6,1in,25.4,0.7,17.4,16621,1.4023,4.4051,1.1813,0.012694,0.054404,0.2,0.0011147,False\n7,1in,25.4,0.8,17.4,18996,1.6026,5.582,1.1461,0.012345,0.052055,0.20003,-0.